From: Helvetica Volubi <suisuroru@blue-millennium.fun>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 01:02:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix creative player item pick

Ported from LophineLabs/Lophine master (0016-Fix-creative-player-item-pick.patch), GPL-3.0 (Lophine repository; MIT opt-in personal, not transitive).
Original author: Helvetica Volubi.
Canvas adaptation: none - direct port.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java
index 1d78f46ebbb126bec1e2c32a7707a2d773b75e8d..a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java
@@ -429,7 +429,7 @@ public class ItemEntity extends Entity implements TraceableEntity {
             Item item = itemStack.getItem();
             int orgCount = itemStack.getCount();
             // CraftBukkit start - fire PlayerPickupItemEvent
-            int canHold = player.getInventory().canHold(itemStack);
+            int canHold = player.hasInfiniteMaterials() ? orgCount : player.getInventory().canHold(itemStack); // Luminol - Fix creative item picking
             int remaining = orgCount - canHold;
             boolean flyAtPlayer = false; // Paper

